{# 🔥 Forming Narratives panel (display-only): emerging themes our models detect — coherent,
   TIGHTENING groups of names not yet in a basket — with clean-entry recommended tickers.

   DROP-IN: add `{% include "_forming_narratives.html.j2" %}` to a baskets template (just
   after the Theme Rotation Desk reads well), and copy site/forming_narratives.js into site/
   in the builder (like lightweight-charts.js). Reads <base>/narrative_emergence.json emitted
   by the builder via engine.narrative_emergence. Self-contained: renders nothing
   (display:none) if the JSON is absent, so it is always safe to include. `ne_base` is the
   page's basketdata folder (default 'basketdata/' for US). #}
<section id="forming-narratives"></section>
<script src="forming_narratives.js"></script>
<script>renderFormingNarratives({ base: "{{ ne_base | default('basketdata/') }}" });</script>
